Hi guys! We're happy to share the latest Breached news with you:

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/24169824/69a668d32602f780abfa61a658a08ed9364ca5d4.png[/img]

- Linux version is finally here! Yay!
- Aberration toggle works fine now;
- You can open all the journal entries now;
- We tweaked synthesis balance a bit. Less randomness, more tactics;
- Few bugs destroyed.

Cheers!

